To compile on Linux / macOS:
cc client.c adapter_clnt.c utils.c -o client

To compile on Windows:
gcc client.c adapter_clnt.c utils.c -o client.exe -lws2_32

To run on Linux / macOS (the server must already be running):
./client 127.0.0.1
./client 127.0.0.1 "Ana Lopez" "Juarez Ave" 800 "Puebla"

To run on Windows:
client.exe 127.0.0.1
client.exe 127.0.0.1 "Ana Lopez" "Juarez Ave" 800 "Puebla"

Files:
  client.c        Initializes and modifies the structure; calls the services
  adapter_clnt.c  Client-side adapter (stub): packs, sends, receives
  utils.c         Socket connection
  client.h        Types, constants and prototypes
